&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;Regulatory assets and regulatory liabilities include shipper imbalances, lost and unaccounted for gas ("LAUF"), Annual Charge Adjustments ("ACA") and excess/grossed up tax adjustments.&amp;#xa0;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

