			&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td style="width: auto;"&gt;
			&lt;p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Operating and Administrative Expenses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
	
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;Since Midla has no employees, operating, maintenance, and general and administrative services are provided under service agreements with the operator.&amp;#xa0;&amp;#xa0;These charges are settled and classifed as Operations Expenses or Administrative/General Expenses on the Statement of Income.&lt;/p&gt;

